# Unprefixed patterns only match the repo root — every workspace package has its own
# node_modules/dist, which needs the same exclusion or a locally-built (host OS/arch) one
# leaks into the image and shadows what the container's own `pnpm install`/`tsc` just built.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/coverage/
**/.turbo/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

*.log

.git/
.github/
.vscode/
.idea/

infra/docker/custom_files/
